00:23:28.733 --> 00:23:31.166
It goes by a few other names as well.

00:23:31.466 --> 00:23:35.766
Sometimes it's called data munching,
sometimes it's called data scrubbing.

00:23:36.400 --> 00:23:37.833
It can also be called data cleaning.

00:23:37.833 --> 00:23:41.066
Or really, it just refers
to the general process of preparing

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:43.200
