So I'm going to go ahead to the next one
and I'm going to put here like,

00:35:38.800 --> 00:35:40.266
like price of

00:35:40.266 --> 00:35:43.333
your service
and this one I'll put it as ordinal.

00:35:43.366 --> 00:35:47.366
Now you see that the levels here stayed
and that's important.

00:35:48.100 --> 00:35:50.400
And the last one
here, I'll just put like, like

