even if it's nominal.

00:38:59.566 --> 00:39:02.266
And then over here
we have levels where we have the one, two,

00:39:02.266 --> 00:39:06.466
three, four or five and we've put labels
on each of those levels.

00:39:06.466 --> 00:39:09.733
So one as strongly as agree to disagree
and so on.

00:39:10.066 --> 00:39:13.000
The reason this is important
is because the numbers

00:39:13.000 --> 00:39:16.600
still are there underneath those labels,

00:39:16.866 --> 00:39:19.500
and that's what makes it possible
