00:40:01.200 --> 00:40:04.166
I'm going to scroll down a little bit
and get to me

00:40:04.200 --> 00:40:06.533
and I'm going to double click on that
to put it in the box,

00:40:07.200 --> 00:40:10.100
and then I need to tell it what variables
