you can give the name of the first one
and then write t o Capital two

00:40:47.700 --> 00:40:51.133
and the last one in terms of you need
to specify each of them separately.

00:40:51.133 --> 00:40:54.900
So I'm going to put a comma
and then I'll click the second one

00:40:55.500 --> 00:40:57.866
and a comma and I'll click the third one.

