00:41:15.833 --> 00:41:18.600
Let me double click on that again

00:41:18.600 --> 00:41:22.166
and then you'll see if I come down here
and I say, It's not integer, but it's

00:41:22.200 --> 00:41:27.000
text, then you see the mean disappears,
