00:41:27.300 --> 00:41:30.766
But if I come back and tell it again
now it's integer than the mean reappears.

00:41:30.766 --> 00:41:32.833
It's able to treat it
as numeric information.

00:41:33.033 --> 00:41:36.866
And so that's how you can average
several variables into a movie,

00:41:37.000 --> 00:41:40.400
which gets you a long way towards
