of comparing relative standing.

00:42:10.366 --> 00:42:14.300
The easiest way to do that is was Z scores
or standardized scores.

00:42:14.766 --> 00:42:18.766
Now, if you've had statistics, you know,
that simply takes the score, subtract

00:42:18.766 --> 00:42:21.466
the mean of the variable
and divide by the standard deviation.

00:42:21.833 --> 00:42:24.066
