Say this variable gets this value,
you have to use the two equals signs

00:55:18.700 --> 00:55:24.100
together and that means is equivalent to
so like product is equivalent to four

00:55:24.433 --> 00:55:27.466
or like product is equivalent
to strongly agree.

00:55:27.466 --> 00:55:31.700
That gives me the fours and the fives
the agrees and this strongly agrees.

00:55:31.700 --> 00:55:36.333
And so that's an exploration of how
filters operate many different ways.

00:55:36.333 --> 00:55:36.933
In Jamo,

00:55:36.933 --> 00:55:41.066
they allow you to focus on particular
cases to find the things that are most

00:55:41.100 --> 00:55:45.000
interesting in a particular data
set and drill down to focus on those,

00:55:45.300 --> 00:55:48.433
give them the attention they deserve,
and hopefully get some new insights

00:55:48.433 --> 00:55:49.166
out of your data.

00:55:50.700 --> 00:55:51.500
Our next topic

