that takes all of this other information

03:04:18.300 --> 03:04:18.900
and we'll just

03:04:18.900 --> 03:04:21.333
drag them over to right there.

03:04:23.033 --> 03:04:25.533
It should show up in a second

03:04:25.533 --> 03:04:27.200
and dragging all of them at once.

03:04:27.200 --> 03:04:29.233
Going to try adding them one at a time.

03:04:29.233 --> 03:04:33.600
Here, I'm going to click Instagram
