03:04:42.033 --> 03:04:45.900
and then it's going to see how much better
the correlations get.

03:04:45.900 --> 03:04:47.166
The associations get.

03:04:47.166 --> 03:04:50.866
When we put in these other variables,
I'm just dragging them over one at a time.

03:04:50.866 --> 03:04:54.200
It's going to take a moment
to update everything here.

03:04:54.633 --> 03:04:57.866
Privacy and, University

03:04:58.500 --> 03:05:01.300
and mortgage

03:05:01.800 --> 03:05:05.600
and volunteering and museum

03:05:06.933 --> 03:05:09.900
and scrapbook

03:05:09.900 --> 03:05:12.300
and modern dance.

03:05:12.300 --> 03:05:13.766
So we'll see what those are able to add.

03:05:13.766 --> 03:05:17.166
In addition, it's going to take a moment
for it to update the results here.

03:05:18.266 --> 03:05:21.733
Comparison of two different models,
because I entered them in blocks.

03:05:21.733 --> 03:05:25.533
The first one has just the governor
and it actually is

03:05:25.533 --> 03:05:27.200
associated a little bit there.

03:05:27.200 --> 03:05:30.300
If you want to see the specific results,
we can come here and click

03:05:30.666 --> 03:05:34.433
model one
and that shows us just the governor.

03:05:34.433 --> 03:05:40.033
And what's interesting is when we have
only whether the governor of a state

03:05:40.033 --> 03:05:45.366
is Democratic or Republican,
we actually get a strong association.

03:05:46.266 --> 03:05:49.233
And that reminds us that's very different
from what we had

03:05:49.233 --> 03:05:50.833
when we entered everything at once.

03:05:50.833 --> 03:05:54.833
Now, let's take a look at model two,
which in addition to that,

03:05:55.100 --> 03:05:56.000
as the other variables.

03:05:56.000 --> 03:05:57.966
Now, by the way,
when is just the governor?

03:05:57.966 --> 03:06:00.566
You see, we have an R squared of 0.148.

03:06:00.600 --> 03:06:02.500
That's not bad.

03:06:02.500 --> 03:06:05.233
When we throw in the other variables,
it goes all the way up to .69.

03:06:05.633 --> 03:06:10.233
And that change from model
one to model two where the R squared up

03:06:10.233 --> 03:06:14.133
