03:06:32.400 --> 03:06:34.700
And this gets to the results that we had
previously.

03:06:35.100 --> 03:06:36.233
We're scrapbooking.

03:06:36.233 --> 03:06:38.866
They're in a different order
because I drag them in differently.

03:06:38.866 --> 03:06:40.400
Scrapbooking nearly significant,

03:06:40.400 --> 03:06:44.566
and maintenance is the only one that's
