video on Linear Regression,
I showed you how to set up the most basic

03:13:40.166 --> 03:13:43.933
version of linear regression,
which is called simultaneous entry,

03:13:43.933 --> 03:13:47.733
where you take all of your predictors
and you put them in the model at.

03:13:47.733 --> 03:13:50.500
And when it gives you
is this one that we have right here,

03:13:51.000 --> 03:13:53.400
which gives you the T

03:13:53.533 --> 03:13:56.833
values and the P values
allow you to hypothesis tests

03:13:57.133 --> 03:14:00.566
on all of your variables,
but only in the context of each other.

03:14:00.766 --> 03:14:03.766
And if you select different variables,
or sometimes

03:14:03.766 --> 03:14:07.200
if you put them in different order,
you can get results.

03:14:07.533 --> 03:14:10.200
Now, I want to show you
some of the options that your movie

03:14:10.200 --> 03:14:11.633
