04:22:46.600 --> 04:22:49.633
And so depending
on the nature of your data,

04:22:50.066 --> 04:22:54.033
you could do either
the chi test of association

04:22:54.033 --> 04:22:58.066
or independent, or you could do something
a little more sophisticated

04:22:58.266 --> 04:22:59.533
with the log linear regression.

04:22:59.533 --> 04:23:03.300
And the great thing is that the movie
