04:32:19.833 --> 04:32:20.233
When you

04:32:20.233 --> 04:32:24.033
have a novel data set either
because you created your own questions

04:32:24.033 --> 04:32:25.200
and you got your own data,

04:32:25.200 --> 04:32:26.466
