right here is called a parallel analysis
that's shown by these yellow dots.

04:38:56.666 --> 04:38:59.333
That's
where it looks at a random structure

04:38:59.333 --> 04:39:02.633
and tries to see if we have something
better than what's random.

04:39:03.966 --> 04:39:04.800
There's also

04:39:04.800 --> 04:39:07.800
what's called the elbow test,
where you look at where things curve.

04:39:08.633 --> 04:39:12.866
And because I happen to know that
there are five factors supposed to be in

