04:39:26.366 --> 04:39:29.366
with the data where we have ten variables
on each of five different

04:39:30.300 --> 04:39:30.900
well, wait a second.

04:39:30.900 --> 04:39:33.900
For that to load up,
we've lost the one reference line here.

04:39:33.900 --> 04:39:36.966
So this plots exactly the same
